{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1475669-tc-aberrant-\u2013-best-at-what-i-do","id":1475669,"title":"TC: Aberrant \u2013 Best at What I Do","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-02T10:39:02-08:00","id":1475669,"title":"TC: Aberrant \u2013 Best at What I Do","content":"Eddy: Another great <b>Aberrant </b>book coming out of the blocks! We\u2019re going to have a lot of great support books for <b>TC: Aberrant</b>.<br /> <br /> Another Aberrant book that I am excited for! I know that these aren't going strictly along the same lines as the 1e books, but this one calls to mind the Elites book to me. However, regardless of where the novas are on the hero/villain spectrum, there are likely to be some that are as stated &quot;The best at what they do&quot;! Wondering if anyone else has speculation on this one<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-02T11:37:16-08:00","id":1475673,"title":"","content":"That is the 3rd book of the sequence, one for Super Heroes Teams (Utopia), one for Outcasts (Terats) and this one for 3rd parties (Elites).<br /> <br /> I guess we will have one for Space Exploration soon, completing the 4 main Nova societies/themes (considering Aeon and Directive are not really Nova societies, but baseline societies specialized into dealing with Novas).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-02T13:55:10-08:00","id":1475681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1475669-tc-aberrant-\u2013-best-at-what-i-do?p=1475673#post1475673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is the 3rd book of the sequence, one for Super Heroes Teams (Utopia), one for Outcasts (Terats) and this one for 3rd parties (Elites).<br /> <br /> I guess we will have one for Space Exploration soon, completing the 4 main Nova societies/themes (considering Aeon and Directive are not really Nova societies, but baseline societies specialized into dealing with Novas).</div> </div> </div> </div>As excited as I am for all these extra books, I really want to see one about the Directive. I especially want to see the perspective of intelligence agents, law enforcers, and soldiers who suddenly found themselves going from dealing with regular humans to try and contain literal gods. What do they think? How do they adapt? Can they keep up?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-03T15:29:26-08:00","id":1475746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1475669-tc-aberrant-\u2013-best-at-what-i-do?p=1475681#post1475681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As excited as I am for all these extra books, I really want to see one about the Directive. I especially want to see the perspective of intelligence agents, law enforcers, and soldiers who suddenly found themselves going from dealing with regular humans to try and contain literal gods. What do they think? How do they adapt? Can they keep up?</div> </div> </div> </div>This would be cool. Also more mechanics (perhaps with some gameplay testing) on how to mix up novas &amp; talents together. I'm running a Talents &amp; Nova game (see APEX thread) and find &quot;half-strength&quot; (i.e. 75pts chargen) novas work best for balance between players. Am thinking of writing something up for that if I get the time. So many possibilities for games mixing the two 'splats'. Hell, with minimal effort you could run a game of Heroes quite easily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26905-eternl-knight","name":"Eternl Knight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26905_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-04T15:51:52-08:00","id":1475803,"title":"","content":"For me, it's offworld expeditions. We already have hints in TC Aeon, that there was vastly more exploration going on than originally assumed, and that &quot;millions&quot; of humans left with the Aberrants after the ultimatum, willingly or otherwise. So I'd really like more of a set up for what exploration is like during this period. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-04T16:53:26-08:00","id":1475810,"title":"","content":"A book about space exploration in the nova age would be awesome, really hoping that it will be announced soon, but also for me the next book will be about elites.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}